title: Boycotting?
subtitle: Should we boycott this next election?
view-if: chancellor = "Papen" and papen_time == 1
on-arrival: chancellor_party = "I"; finance_minister_party = "I"; interior_minister_party = "DNVP"; economic_minister_party = "I"; labor_minister_party = "I"; justice_minister_party = "DNVP"; foreign_minister_party = "I"; agriculture_minister_party = "DNVP"; reichswehr_minister = "I"
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/juan_manuel_galvez.jpeg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= Boycotting

Many members of our party have been calling for us to boycott these elections, hoping to decrease the regime's legitimacy and help the <span style="color: #e8670c;">democratic</span> movement to arise agaisnt the <span style="color: #007DBC;">**PNH**</span> dictatorship.

However, some others have called for us to participate, considering Andino's chosen succesor, Juan Manuel Galvez, has been somewhat conciliatory towards us and even some leftists hope for a detente with the <span style="color: #007DBC;">**PNH**</span>.

What are we to do?

- @boycott
- @no_boycott

@boycott
title: Boycott this rigged election!
subtitle: Are we sure? This could just give Parliament to the <span style="color: #007DBC;">**PNH**</span>. Then again, the electoral system is rigged.

The <span style="color: #CE2029;">**PLH**</span> and <span style="color: #e8670c;">**PDRH**</span>  will boycott this rigged election. We call upon our voters to not vote and boycott efficacy is actually high.

@no_boycott
title: Maybe we should have a try in elections..
subtitle: Are we really going to participate in a rigged election?

We have chosen to not boycott the election, and the <span style="color: #007DBC;">**PNH**</span>'s government legitimacy has gone up significantly internationally due to this. Unfortunately, this does not benefit us in any way.
